  "intro_html": "<p>A grand ascent. At first glance the north flank of the Fronalpstock appears somewhat repellent, but it proves an easy climb. Unsurprisingly, the view from the summit is amazing; above Lake Lucerne, the Fronalpstock is known to have one of the best panoramic views in the region.</p>\n<p>Popular viewing point above Lake Lucerne, accessible by chairlift from the village of Stoos. A few metres below the summit there is an restaurant with overnight accommodation.</p>",
